# AI-hint: Defines the root-level git exclusion rules for the MiOS repository, implementing a "block-all-then-whitelist" strategy to isolate MiOS-owned files from the mirrored system root during bootc builds.
# AI-related: mios-btop.sh, /usr/share/mios/kb, /usr/share/mios/kb/, /usr/share/mios/kb/manifest.json, /etc/mios/kb.conf.toml, /etc/mios/eval-criteria.json, /etc/mios/system-prompts/, /etc/mios/ai/, /etc/mios/ai/system-prompt.md, /etc/mios/opencode/

/*
.*
!.prompt.MD
!/ARTIFACT-PROMPT.md

# Windows Host Namespaces (Strict Level-by-Level Isolation)
/$Recycle.Bin
/$Recycle.Bin/**
/$WINDOWS.~BT
/$WINDOWS.~BT/**
