/Recovery/**
/Riot Games
/Riot Games/**
/System Volume Information
/System Volume Information/**
/Users
/Users/**
/Windows
/Windows/**
/XboxGames
/XboxGames/**
/inetpub
/inetpub/**
/TEMP
/TEMP/**

# Windows Path Literal Block Rules
C:\Windows
C:\Windows\**
C:\Program Files
C:\Program Files\**
C:\Program Files (x86)
C:\Program Files (x86)\**
