# ADR-0030 Decision 7: the legacy archive, a bare git store beside .git. Only HEAD, config, the
# branch and the one pack are tracked; `mios-gen archive --check` rejects anything else on disk.
!/.archive/
/.archive/*
!/.archive/HEAD
!/.archive/config
!/.archive/refs/
!/.archive/objects/
/.archive/objects/*
!/.archive/objects/pack/
!/.secrets/
!/.secrets/README.md
/.secrets/*
!/.secrets/README.md
!/.github/
!/.github/**
